{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43270","headline":"律中应钟 · 裴元","name":"律中应钟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"律穷方数寸，室暗在三重。\n伶管灰先动，秦正节已逢。\n商声辞玉笛，羽调入金钟。\n密叶翻霜彩，轻冰歛水容。\n望鸿南去绝，迎气北来浓。\n愿托无凋性，寒林自比松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43270.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43270","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}